 $441 at Barclays\n\nBarclays lowered the firm’s price target on UnitedHealth (UNH) to $440 from $441 and keeps an Overweight rating on the shares. The firm updated the company’s model post the Q3…\n\n10 days ago - TheFly\n\n### UNH Earnings Beat & Raise Not Enough for Wall Street: Are Investors Underpricing Stock?\n\nUnitedHealth (UNH) shares initially rallied after posting an earnings beat on the top and bottom line, with guidance also coming in above Wall Street estimates. The stock reversed within the first hou...\n\n### UnitedHealth Group Stock Gains on Strong Earnings\n\nUnitedHealth Group shares are on the rise after a better-than-expected earnings report.\n\n### UnitedHealth says costs remain stubbornly high across healthcare landscape\n\nSays revised FY26 guidance reflects continuing improvements in leadership and execution across Optum and UnitedHealth (UNH)care. Says introducing AI-powered plan recommendations that use a member’s ca...\n\n### UnitedHealth Group Earnings Call Transcript: Q3 2026\n\nQ3 revenue was $113B and adjusted EPS was $4.69; 2026 adjusted EPS guidance is at least $20.50. Leadership cited improving execution and a 2027 growth opportunity, balanced against elevated medical costs and investment needs.\n\n### UnitedHealth Group Earnings release: Q3 2026\n\nUnitedHealth Group released its Q3 2026 earnings on October 13, 2026, summarizing the period's financial results.\n\n### UnitedHealth stock rises on earnings beat, raised 2026 profit forecast\n\nUnitedHealth Group shares climbed about 1.5% in premarket trading on Tuesday after the US health insurer reported third-quarter earnings above analyst expectations and raised its full-year 2026 profit...\n\n### UnitedHealth keeps medical costs under control — and raises its outlook again\n\n### UnitedHealth Charts Continued Turnaround","title":"UnitedHealth Group (UNH) Stock Price & Overview","url":"https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/unh/"},{"author":null,"id":"https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/unh